                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 平台列表生成界面，不把平台数量写死；新增平台补名称、图标、连接方式与数据适配即可复用主面板、七列日志与灵动岛。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yieIi",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 「打开主面板」进入总览时定位到灵动岛当前平台、连接与统计来源，打开后浏览别的平台不回写灵动岛配置。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qp981",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 有些本地记录无法归属到账号：这类来源标注「本平台本机记录，无法按账号区分」，并说明连接过滤不适用。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FWK5c",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 未来第三方转发连接的平台归属由配置确定，不能仅靠模型名称推断供应商；产品平台与实际计费方分别保存，七列表格不因此增加列。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GVt0i",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 新增平台接入前必须验证：授权方式与权限、实际额度窗口、来源字段、请求级记录可用性、Token / 缓存口径、成本来源与刷新限制。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
