                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "XOtMf",
                      "name": "T",
                      "fill": "$pn-island-text-primary",
                      "content": "探出后双击",
                      "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "yZxbr",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "在探出状态下双击才进入展开态；对停靠条本身双击 = 解除停靠、回到自由态",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "BjhDj",
              "name": "Annotations",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yvfXs",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 形态层级：自由态（收缩 / 展开）与停靠态是两个维度。停靠 = 位置贴边 + 尺寸收到极小；收缩 / 展开 = 信息量多少。停靠态比收缩态更收一级。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pDriu",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 手势：桌面端用「按住直接拖动」，不使用长按——长按是触屏手势，且会与既有的「双击展开、单击不展开」挤在一起。停靠条上双击 = 解除停靠回到自由收缩态；探出后双击才进入展开态。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "asEfv",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 停靠条只保留水位颜色一个信号，不显示平台名、百分比、倒计时与 Token 增量文字。需要具体数值时悬停探出即可，无需先解除停靠。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ei3PA",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 左右边缘转为竖向条，水位自下而上生长；上下边缘为横向条，水位自左向右生长。两种形态共用同一套阈值与颜色。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XcnkZ",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 吸附按当前显示器的工作区计算，不跨显示器、不覆盖 Windows 任务栏；多显示器下记录「显示器 + 边缘 + 沿边偏移」，显示器变更后回落到最近的有效边缘。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HXjW8",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Token 增量在停靠态不显示数字，改为水位条一次约 300ms 的轻微亮度脉冲；无新增事件时不播放，遵循减少动态效果偏好时直接跳过该脉冲。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jChLK",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 停靠位置、所在边缘与沿边偏移需持久化；重启后恢复到上次停靠状态。相关开关归入设置「悬浮窗附加选项」（位置 / 透明度 / 大小），不新增一级设置页。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zKJTz",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· 未连接、查询失败、来源不可用时停靠条只保留空轨道，不着色也不画成满格——与「真实已用 100%」区分，规则与第 3 节一致。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
