            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "a9iGi",
              "name": "Annotations",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mcOWe",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1 · 「开启分身」：以右键所在岛的连接为初始值，新窗口在其右下 24px 自由态出现；总数上限 8，达到上限禁用。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "woJOv",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2 · 「销毁分身」：销毁右键所在的岛；总数为 1 时禁用。销毁本体时第一个分身接任本体，托盘摘要与主面板默认连接随之切换。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zo0MH",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3 · 右上角数字：灵动岛总数（含本体），纯数字、等宽 11px、text-tertiary；可访问名称「当前 N 个灵动岛」。只出现在灵动岛右键菜单，托盘菜单不显示。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nfMxW",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "4 · 每个岛独立持久化：连接、停靠边与沿边偏移、自由态位置；重启后按原样重建。「切换连接」「显示位置」的勾选态按右键所在的岛显示。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yax1D",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "5 · 全局共享：始终置顶、透明度 / 大小、免打扰、显示 / 隐藏灵动岛对所有岛同时生效。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ePPNr",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "6 · 「重置窗口位置」：本体回主屏居中并解除停靠，分身解除停靠后依次向右下错开 24px。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$pn-island-font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "PeSjK",
                  "name": "Note",
                  "fill": "$pn-island-text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
